Is there a way to randomly sample a subset of my SNP data, say 13 SNPs out of ~3k, in adegenet when I read in a STRUCTURE file?

boot_1 <-
  read.structure(
    ?snps.str",
    onerowperind = TRUE,
    n.ind = 16,
    n.loc = 2468,
    ask = FALSE,
    quiet = TRUE
  )

